<title>UK: Courtaulds Textiles yr profits down sharply.</title>
<headline>Courtaulds Textiles yr profits down sharply.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.0 loss	     vs 25.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 10.1		   vs 10.1</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 15.3		   vs 15.3</p>
<p> Pretax		     0.4		    vs 36.5</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.01 billion	 vs 1.12 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 1.5 and 6.0 million stg. The full-year result was affected by an exceptional charge of 31.7 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Courtaulds Textiles Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
